                    <BzTableRow><BzTableCell><code>success</code>, <code>warning</code>, <code>info</code> (+ <code>-foreground</code>)</BzTableCell><BzTableCell>The status set. It drives the success, warning and info variants and the <code>StatusColor</code> parameter on form controls.</BzTableCell></BzTableRow>
